  "description": "ASP.NET Core gRPC integration for the Pulse CQRS mediator. Provides the PulseGrpcStreamService base class that forwards server-streaming RPCs to IMediator.StreamQueryAsync, writing every yielded item to the IServerStreamWriter with full client cancellation support, and the MapStreamQueryGrpc extension method that registers such services on an IEndpointRouteBuilder. Shipped as a separate package so the core ASP.NET Core integration stays free of any gRPC dependency.",
